(Loss) Attributable to Medalist Common Shareholders</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.44%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.01%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquarePropertyMember_H-8Q8Y0nOEG1UdvbGV2w9w" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" scale="0" id="Tc_AhZRrnS1dkCCdfUdaJPSkw_20_3">2,294,606</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.72%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.01%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_3_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquarePropertyMember_fhGncd40VEuX7mSOpSOFgQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:NetIncomeLoss" sign="-" scale="0" id="Tc_56En12hXvEWJxu7QJ80low_20_6">6,436</ix:nonFraction>)</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.41%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">2024 Property Acquisitions</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Acquisition of 16% noncontrolling interest in the Hanover Square Outparcel</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">On March 25, 2024, the Company completed the acquisition of its tenant in common partner&#8217;s <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_3_25_2024_To_3_25_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquareOutparcelMember_XPJ4XnHGhUSECUizcijZog" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AcquisitionOfMinorityInterestOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_LJiSRw-6IES9eujGK0mmsg">16</ix:nonFraction>% ownership interest in the Hanover Square Outparcel through a wholly-owned subsidiary. &#160;The purchase price for the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_3_25_2024_To_3_25_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquareOutparcelMember_XPJ4XnHGhUSECUizcijZog" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AcquisitionOfMinorityInterestOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_tWjcrxOmW0KvnEIDYyn93g">16</ix:nonFraction>% interest in the Hanover Square Outparcel was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_3_25_2024_To_3_25_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquareOutparcelMember_XPJ4XnHGhUSECUizcijZog" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsToAcquireProductiveAssets" scale="0" id="Narr_4N7kEKzPqECeDPAMr9Np6g">98,411</ix:nonFraction> paid in cash. &#160;The Company&#8217;s total investment was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_3_25_2024_To_3_25_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquareOutparcelMember_XPJ4XnHGhUSECUizcijZog" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_44wdyHfoQEy7wEYyTPrlnw">100,891</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_3_25_2024_To_3_25_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_HanoverSquareOutparcelMember_XPJ4XnHGhUSECUizcijZog" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredTransactionCost" scale="0" id="Narr_QhuJcsXj5k2hRePi2aYrtQ">2,480</ix:nonFraction> of closing costs which were capitalized and added to the tangible assets acquired. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Citibank Property</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.25;text-align:justify;text-indent:32.4pt;margin:0pt 2.95pt 0pt 3pt;">On March 28, 2024, the Company completed its acquisition of the Citibank Property, a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_sqft_0Zc1p00BFk2_BA2jvuxilQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_28_2024_xWgCYntj0Emsow_kFxd-ug" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AreaOfBuilding" scale="0" id="Narr_cullkUShYkCFh1TLa1_wtw">4,350</ix:nonFraction> square foot single tenant building on <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_acre_m_l_0O8ot0aVoV0Bukb2ZQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_a2DrojD7O0S6TmtVquPsUw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AreaOfLand" scale="0" id="Narr_5Or5bbDvbUua2rg-RQHFWw">0.45</ix:nonFraction> acres located in Chicago, Illinois, through a wholly-owned subsidiary, from RMP 3535 N. Central Ave., LLC. &#160;The sole manager and member of RMP 3535 N. Central Ave., LLC is CWS BET Seattle, LP, a Delaware limited partnership, a company controlled and owned by Frank Kavanaugh, the Company&#8217;s Chief Executive Officer and a member of the Company&#8217;s Board of Directors. &#160;The Citibank Property, built in 1954 and subsequently renovated, was <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_a2DrojD7O0S6TmtVquPsUw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AssetAcquisitionLeasedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_zo_I96yYHUSQdvGtmuE82Q">100</ix:nonFraction>% leased to Citibank, NA. &#160;The purchase price for the Citibank Property was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_3_28_2024_To_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_kJZoikOv-UeUmgcJFml83w" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredEquityInterestIssuedAndIssuable" scale="0" id="Narr_Hjq4lnDTqU2pInrl67Eoag">2,400,000</ix:nonFraction> paid through the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="Duration_3_28_2024_To_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_kJZoikOv-UeUmgcJFml83w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredNumberOfOperatingPartnershipUnitsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_d_NrsN5Kh02yLcqvnOpurg">417,391</ix:nonFraction> operating partnership units at a price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_oqoAh1iy2UGxOWXMFrn7FQ" contextRef="Duration_3_28_2024_To_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_kJZoikOv-UeUmgcJFml83w" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredNumberOfOperatingPartnershipUnitsIssuedPricePerUnit" scale="0" id="Narr_WvTblTmKUUaDhYiibvAxaA">5.75</ix:nonFraction> per operating partnership unit. &#160;The Company&#8217;s total investment was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_3_28_2024_To_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_kJZoikOv-UeUmgcJFml83w" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferred" scale="0" id="Narr_5T6nFR7YW0W5f5UYQ0vUoA">2,444,454</ix:nonFraction>. &#160;The Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_3_28_2024_To_3_28_2024_us-gaap_AssetAcquisitionAxis_mdrr_CitibankPropertyMember_kJZoikOv-UeUmgcJFml83w" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:AssetAcquisitionConsiderationTransferredTransactionCost" scale="0" id="Narr_tmEG20-FOkaeq97gLPe1Gw">44,454</ix:nonFraction> of closing costs which were capitalized and added to the tangible assets acquired. &#160;</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_AssetAcquisitions2024Member_DP9rfBrsY0qiuV1zjsOk2A" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfRecognizedIdentifiedAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedTableTextBlock" id="Tb_RU8-OB8jf0O5155DPjwWWA" continuedAt="Tb_RU8-OB8jf0O5155DPjwWWA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">19</p></div></div>
