ation_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_srt_StatementScenarioAxis_mdrr_MonthlyPaymentsAfterSpecifiedDateMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_8F-beAqUl0G0RQrFlyKjBw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_-8Yx-SYdcUy4ZSRGVzQzGg">61,800</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, which includes interest and principal based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_iYZRzP1llkqCzgjrE1fhmQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_Rs6ZgvS76EmxRuB7X4MN8w"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">thirty-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule. The mortgage loan includes covenants for the Company to maintain a net worth of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_T72Qmd11JkOa3GtN1l2G9A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsNetWorthCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_J1mYX79u2kWGy9qNPNAhUw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_T72Qmd11JkOa3GtN1l2G9A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsNetWorthCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_YXWQBQn2C02TaxYH3xesPg">13,250,000</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, excluding the assets and liabilities associated with the Franklin Square Property and for the Company to maintain liquid assets of no less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_T72Qmd11JkOa3GtN1l2G9A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_gWJEzl4MsUehrsTqqiPJKw">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants. The Company has guaranteed the payment and performance of the obligations of the mortgage loan.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(b)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><spa