"font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, excluding the liabilities associated with the mortgage loan for the Brookfield Center Property, and for the Company to maintain liquid assets of no less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_BrookfieldCenterPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_peD7sHD0qUOvdrLUBWFMOQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_QV6aFsiiW0aas4p3ol_Dcg">485,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(d)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The interest rate for the mortgage loan for the Parkway Property was originally based on ICE LIBOR plus </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_mdrr_IntercontinentalExchangeLondonInterbankOfferedRateIceLiborMember_zs27kPPEqk2Tkoa_4wnEJw" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-4" id="Narr_6aRxw-oVfEeUVUVuRThbLg">225</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> basis points, with a minimum rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_mdrr_IntercontinentalExchangeLondonInterbankOfferedRateIceLiborMember_6tcURPYRhUuvXLTeCBSdVg" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_GDPTAmyzEEqXWP6KOatsCQ">2.25</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">%. &#160;After the discontinuation of LIBOR on June 30, 2023, the ICE LIBOR index was replaced by Term SOFR, with an adjusted margin of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2023_To_6_30_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_us-gaap_VariableRateAxis_us-gaap_SecuredOvernightFinancingRateSofrOvernightIndexSwapRateMember_C41MD7wzYEGucZvHDE_xsA" decimals="6" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentBasisSpreadOnVariableRate1" scale="-4" id="Narr_9olM0ASZG0GZbVPZzthcNQ">236.44</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> basis points. &#160;Under the terms of the mortgage, the interest rate payable each month shall not change by greater than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_h5aVjGH5s0mclpyZacWAzg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentThresholdChangeInInterestPayableDuringSixMonths" scale="-2" id="Narr_Phf8AGvBKUiN71dUx0jG7w">1</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% during any six-month period and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_h5aVjGH5s0mclpyZacWAzg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentThresholdChangeInInterestPayableDuringTwelveMonths" scale="-2" id="Narr_lhwSMrYm6kq0g2LZuIiCdw">2</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% during any 12-month period. &#160;As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023 the rate in effect for the Parkway Property mortgage was </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_j-cz1e3S7EublNZnkzDAzA" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateDuringPeriod" scale="-2" id="Narr_j83gQ--iL0G9OsAxq-JOKw">7.05</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">%. The monthly payment, which varies based on the interest rate in effect each month, includes interest at the variable rate, and principal based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_j-cz1e3S7EublNZnkzDAzA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_p5DAblj690-0nlPh0_DskQ"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">thirty-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule. &#160;The mortgage loan for the Parkway Property includes a covenant to maintain a debt service coverage ratio of </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_ParkwayPropertyMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_P9Tt1SszCECSG40NkIrLLA" name="mdrr:DebtServiceCoverageRatio" id="Narr_RG0dBPOfu0SGuHHVoydC3Q"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">not less than 1.30 to 1.00 on an annual basis</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. &#160;As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with this covenant.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(e)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">On June 13, 2022, the Company entered into a mortgage loan facility with Wells Fargo Bank (the &#8220;Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility&#8221;) in the principal amount of $</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_TwPy9lkt10WZBrkZqk7PKw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_29TndFfnGEyVkFsnSVEveA">18,609,500</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. &#160;The proceeds of this mortgage were used to finance the acquisition of the Salisbury Marketplace Property and to refinance the mortgages payable on the Lancer Center Property and the Greenbrier Business Center Property. &#160;The Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility bears interest at a fixed rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_TwPy9lkt10WZBrkZqk7PKw" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentInterestRateStatedPercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr__J8QBPokRkKlq_xHEuQobQ">4.50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">% for a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember__ezcmfqQUkm9kWXoinn7lQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:MaturityTerm" id="Narr_rbLNgixx_E2a9uF1GIP3lw"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">five-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> term. &#160;The </span></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">22</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_fa84b3ac_76ad_4af3_b382_8c23878b8d0f"></a><a id="Tc_5114DXz540akv18K83fzrQ_1_8"></a><a id="Tc_x4Y7Mrxk60KRMr_gIePaIQ_2_9"></a><a id="Tc_9xyCnNrQRUytUy0VaEaxTQ_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_fez5RXZyrEeEpCw6Wy8w8Q_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_1r1AzT_P7EqjWhm6fKFpIw_3_9"></a><a id="Tc_i0HIn12IhUSl9ASQZFH4CQ_3_12"></a><a id="Tc_V3c893Y8W0aPq7CZIz8Cyw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_ekqcxUJiek2rkGAw1XJ82g_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_ULgl4Sp-ek-ZJNWtyIycOQ_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_I1oYzce88EW77MPae4-2fw_4_6"></a><a id="Tc_B27o9pTB20a4oMHuJ-x8-g_4_8"></a><a id="Tc__cTyrRhZRkqI4DF4i9AMFg_4_11"></a><a id="Tc_ZbBuZRNVtkyyUE69Esk7mw_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_6vOn77dAEEulMK8_UkAviQ_5_1"></a><a id="Tc_Dv2OICSkQUiQJ8vr6DmTUA_5_5"></a><a id="Tc_Bz5NyOy-5kO7bHutWALsCA_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_uAGu0Y9K9U2b3oEgdWFz7Q_5_9"></a><a id="Tc_36TlmpcQf02sAdJ9CYrgGg_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_f7vQT3OU6UOzJ6gQ5es1tQ_6_9"></a><a id="Tc_fE_ntmRygESf8tj5iklOmg_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_XWvIybJz8U25qcGjgfkAlA_7_8"></a><a id="Tc_y3didSeM8UaRItViDrFQdA_7_9"></a><a id="Tc_oG_1Nhz64UGftLNb8zaONw_7_11"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_dGAijTfABEuzAwEv03nk2w_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_dGAijTfABEuzAwEv03nk2w_cont2"><ix:continuation id="Tb_k1R8IwCk8UaffR19Qjssvg_cont1"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">monthly payment, which includes interest at the fixed rate, and principal, based on a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember__ezcmfqQUkm9kWXoinn7lQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentAmortizationSchedule" id="Narr_4wpTbMU16EC5wZHtVSQ4RA"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">twenty-five-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> amortization schedule, is </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember__ezcmfqQUkm9kWXoinn7lQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentPeriodicPayment" scale="0" id="Narr_lIpVYnUkDU6K5xH-0Xpeag">103,438</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. &#160;The Company has provided an unconditional guaranty of the payment of and performance under the terms of the Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility. &#160;The Wells Fargo Mortgage Facility credit agreement includes covenants to maintain a debt service coverage ratio of </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_6_13_2022_To_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_JJVk6Oye6EKJzwR7iEoJ8Q" name="mdrr:DebtServiceCoverageRatio" id="Narr_fhkN02VMnEqJ6nTvfWJVqA"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">not less than 1.50 to 1.00</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> on an annual basis, a combined minimum debt yield of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_TwPy9lkt10WZBrkZqk7PKw" decimals="3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumDebtYieldCovenant" scale="-2" id="Narr_a9GW7FZe40iXNSgQMu4zkQ">9.5</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> on the Salisbury Marketplace Property, the Lancer Center Property and the Greenbrier Business Center Property, and the maintenance of liquid assets of not less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_6_13_2022_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_WellsFargoMortgageFacilityMember_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_mdrr_MortgagesPayableMember_TwPy9lkt10WZBrkZqk7PKw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:DebtInstrumentsMinimumLiquidAssetsCovenant" scale="0" id="Narr_khbxWJhczUyJDnUbhqjWrA">1,500,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">. As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Company believes that it is compliant with these covenants. &#160;</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Guaranty Substitution</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="display:inline-block;text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;width:18pt;"></span><span style="display:inline-block;width:18pt;"></span>Pursuant to the terms of the Termination Agreement, during December 2023, the Company entered into consent agreements with lenders for the Ashley Plaza Property, Brookfield Property, Franklin Square Property and Parkway Property mortgages under which the Company replaced certain guaranty obligations of Messrs. Messier and Elliott. &#160;Under these agreements, the Company assumed guaranties related to environmental waste and acts of fraud, among others, and consented to certain covenants (discussed above) to maintain minimum net worth and liquidity levels. &#160;For the Franklin Square Property mortgage loan, the termination of the Management Agreement was considered an event of default. &#160;Under the consent agreement for the Franklin Square Property mortgage loan, the lender agreed to waive the event of default in exchange for the payment of a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_GLHBVnrLcE6GFmITl6UEaQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LossOnContractTerminationForDefault" scale="0" id="Narr_UBrmvWYUUEqegC0KwumjFg">132,500</ix:nonFraction> consent fee, and the Company&#8217;s agreement to fully guaranty the Franklin Square Property mortgage loan. &#160;The $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis_mdrr_FranklinSquarePropertyMember_nLoA8v0i7kekPzhCrDoC_Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LossOnContractTerminationForDefault" scale="0" id="Narr_TWOxJDAEvEytLUCuFm2v9g">132,500</ix:nonFraction> consent fee was recorded as part of the management restructuring fee on the condensed consolidated statement of operations for the year ended December 31, 2023. &#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_3_31_2024_0NcEWc7ptEezfFrPBG_rBA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:LossOnContractTerminationForDefault" scale="0" id="Narr_X_SbHc9f2kuiayz02O5j2w">No</ix:nonFraction> such expenses were recorded for the three months ended March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and 2023. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Mortgages payable, net, associated with assets held for sale</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 18pt;">The Company&#8217;s mortgages payables, net, associated with assets held for sale, consists of the following:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_c98__lW_mkiq4m2Cg5AVMw" name="mdrr:Sche