-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">$</b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.62%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_BVv4iN2C2EOirQTEjD8z1Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LessorOperatingLeasePaymentsToBeReceived" scale="0" id="Tc_kW5wYJcJBUSQrdlQkaogrw_7_3">31,351,176</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:normal;margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_c98__lW_mkiq4m2Cg5AVMw" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_6o6fZN_-Hkabt7Tdq3vMGQ" continuedAt="Tb_6o6fZN_-Hkabt7Tdq3vMGQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">7.&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Equity</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;padding-bottom:12pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company has authority to issue <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_BVv4iN2C2EOirQTEjD8z1Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:SharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_V7WmZJfGzEmF8S992vtUoQ">1,000,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares consisting of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_BVv4iN2C2EOirQTEjD8z1Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_zcTZLajjwEW_qnpAT1DNOQ">750,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_BVv4iN2C2EOirQTEjD8z1Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_YhpmSxP_7UWPRU8mTYFncw">250,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of preferred stock, $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_oqoAh1iy2UGxOWXMFrn7FQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_BVv4iN2C2EOirQTEjD8z1Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_RO3lahkzDEK4goYd6zicSQ">0.01</ix:nonFraction> par value per share ("Preferred Shares"). Substantially all of the Company&#8217;s business is conducted through its Operating Partnership. The REIT is the sole general partner of the Operating Partnership and owned an <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_utcXTLzhPEujLDOS-Q6yyQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedLiabilityCompanyLLCOrLimitedPartnershipLPMembersOrLimitedPartnersOwnershipInterest" scale="-2" id="Narr_mn7YjEuG3Ui8c-YRUfEIFQ">82.60</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_RrBtLGPrR0K_iz60WEoASg" decimals="4" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedLiabilityCompanyLLCOrLimitedPartnershipLPMembersOrLimitedPartnersOwnershipInterest" scale="-2" id="Narr_8Zjw8DE_R06_KmhjHPS9yQ">98.81</ix:nonFraction>% interest in the Operating Partnership as of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, respectively. &#160;Limited partners in the Operating Partnership who have held their Operating Partnership Units for one&#160;year or longer have the right to redeem their common Operating Partnership Units for cash or, at the REIT&#8217;s option, Common Shares at a ratio of one Operating Partnership Unit for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_ZCrhztxf3EGdyWEJC1ctog" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:CommonUnitToCommonStockConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_TMUTTpCZRUC5_BHHBGN6sw">one</ix:nonFraction> common share. Under the Agreement of Limited Partnership, distributions to Operating Partnership Unit holders are made at the discretion of the REIT. The REIT intends to make distributions in a manner that will result in limited partners of the Operating Partnership receiving distributions at the same rate per Operating Partnership Unit as dividends per share are paid to the REIT&#8217;s holders of Common Shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Completion of 1-for-8 Reverse Stock Split </span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;">On May 3, 2023, the Company completed a reverse stock split of its Common Shares, and a corresponding adjustment to the outstanding common Operating Partnership Units of the Operating Partnership, at a ratio of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_jvx5tJaWTUavjASpLZeclg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">1</span></span>-for-8 (the &#8220;Reverse Stock Split&#8221;). The Reverse Stock Split automatically converted every <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden__PPg7LN58kyzWX3XQp_yJQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">eight</span></span> Common Shares then outstanding into one Common Share.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;background:#ffffff;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Shelf Registration</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On June 21, 2021, the Company filed a shelf registration statement on Form S-3 with the SEC. The Company incurred $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_BVv4iN2C2EOirQTEjD8z1Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:LegalCostsAndFilingFeesIncurred" scale="0" id="Narr_2Ptftf46Z0OhK5ZJUNwOxg"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_oSzpNY2FUEWKT051dgqDQg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:LegalCostsAndFilingFeesIncurred" scale="0" id="Narr_UZdMrzOqK06_e2eeeyVN8A">84,926</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> in legal costs, filing fees and other costs associated with this shelf registration statement which are recorded as offering costs as part of stockholders' equity on the Company&#8217;s condensed consolidated balance sheets as of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, respectively. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">Common Shares and Operating Partnership Units Outstanding</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_vLCOIRi3FkGQB3ni2IG9Mg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_W55tqig4U0SGYA38Fqlhjg">2,707,679</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_ySfv-b1KJUSdC5sajFMung" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_Eby1k7N0CkapVN2GV7difQ">2,245,501</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units outstanding, respectively, with the REIT owning <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_d9RPzEA4MU2RBp59CwXbjQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_yUUHgtD4v0Kzneu5d8H-Sw">2,236,631</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_NlLaZrej3k6jhqbn0ZScMQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_9xl6aonvhkm7gNxwf6ItkQ">2,218,810</ix:nonFraction> of these Operating Partnership Units, respectively. As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, the remaining <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_DDUIK9RGmkS8yZ4J6mYkMQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_MJREktqIWEWS5V8EnuqMog">471,048</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_-cNtdZry60CehlgyVRAH8A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_ZR_vIOyxnkiq_T7BMLODuQ">26,691</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units, respectively, are held by noncontrolling, limited partners. &#160;As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, respectively, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_dei_LegalEntityAxis_mdrr_MedalistDiversifiedRealEstateInvestmentTrustMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_nVdR5wEi4EWu4u3Xx4yHGw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_CSaYtL_PhUasWWrIUIBhaQ">2,236,631</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_dei_LegalEntityAxis_mdrr_MedalistDiversifiedRealEstateInvestmentTrustMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_GeneralPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_HYRIDOWKME2cqOdakm2C5g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_KGGMdAsMXE2DwdpkvHiKgA">2,218,810</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares of the REIT outstanding, respectively. As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and December&#160;31,&#160;2023, there were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_FJDGuZEahUO5Zy1nXP9Qtg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:CommonUnitsEligibleForConversion" scale="0" id="Narr_0-hCdNerHE6HfUEPzaGDbw">14,960</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_7YGa4_aL20GRg1M-6EAHBQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:CommonUnitsEligibleForConversion" scale="0" id="Narr_osffOivESkS6KM2S1XTf0g">26,691</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units, respectively, held by noncontrolling, limited partners that were eligible for conversion to Common Shares.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">26</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_6o6fZN_-Hkabt7Tdq3vMGQ_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_6o6fZN_-Hkabt7Tdq3vMGQ_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">2018 Equity Incentive Plan</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s 2018 Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;Equity Incentive Plan&#8221;) was adopted by the Board on July&#160;27, 2018 and approved by the Company&#8217;s shareholders on August&#160;23, 2018. The Equity Incentive Plan permits the grant of stock options, stock appreciation rights, stock awards, performance units, incentive awards and other equity-based awards (including LTIP units of the Company&#8217;s Operating Partnership) to its employees or an affiliate (as defined in the Equity Incentive Plan) of the Company and for up to the greater of (i)&#160;<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_8_23_2018_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_41weShY6c0KwvaxawU9ZiQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_h9nu5KTL-kGL4IbrKIKItw">30,000</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares and (ii)&#160;eight&#160;percent (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="Duration_8_23_2018_To_8_23_2018_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_SO3mJQ2ltE-RKxni8ydSgw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:FullyDilutedSharesOfCommonSharesPercent" scale="-2" id="Narr_RkSHBgs-hUCM4Wid-7gclg">8</ix:nonFraction>)% of the number of fully diluted shares of the Company&#8217;s Common Shares (taking into account interests in the Operating Partnership that may become convertible into Common Shares).</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 18, 2024, the Compensation Committee approved a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="Duration_1_18_2024_To_1_18_2024_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementNonemployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_qhVkoPMR2Eqj3KKn8UX4TA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_tjIAL7uhVEWWhSWWnToSyw">15,275</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to the Company&#8217;s <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_wzSW8slQa0CKnVzkhAFOow" contextRef="Duration_1_18_2024_To_1_18_2024_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_us-gaap_ShareBasedPaymentArrangementNonemployeeMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_qhVkoPMR2Eqj3KKn8UX4TA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:NumberOfDirectorsWhoReceivedGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_4eoB5_kaTUq38-VeayqBqA">five</ix:nonFraction> independent directors, a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="Duration_1_18_2024_To_1_18_2024_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_mdrr_ConsultantsMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_n55gjy27d0-W8xlQZF0Mrg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" scale="0" id="Narr_13GaXrWxuU-X_YLRMyDatg">2,546</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares to <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_iHGiEr5wJ0m90vre000_Kg;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">a</span></span> consultant of the Company and a grant of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="Duration_1_18_2024_To_1_18_2024_us-gaap_GranteeStatusAxis_mdrr_PresidentAndChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_t7V1zORsmEm_tbNrswfvBQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:OperatingPartnershipUnitsIssuedForCompensationServices" scale="0" id="Narr_EuZ1awaO9E6IB-L8trzuwg">38,697</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units to the Company&#8217;s President and CEO, under the Equity Incentive Plan. The effective date of the grants was January 18, 2024. The Common Shares granted vested immediately and are unrestricted. &#160;The Operating Partnership Units granted vested immediately but are not convertible to Common Shares until January 18, 2025. &#160;However, the Equity Incentive Plan includes other restrictions on the sale of shares issued under the Equity Incentive Plan. Because the Common Shares and Operating Partnership Units vested immediately, the fair value of the grants, or $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_DIRRZ6XS10yefRwM8kFSJw" contextRef="Duration_1_18_2024_To_1_18_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_9gn6RXsJa0mQYwauFjzuaQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:FairValueOfGrants" scale="0" id="Narr_L6AIeymTZEifQTdIQFUIZg">277,500</ix:nonFraction>, was recorded to share based compensation expense on the Company&#8217;s condensed consolidated statements of operations on the effective date of the grant. The fair value of the grants was determined by the market price of the Company&#8217;s Common Shares on the effective date of the grant.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On each January 1 during the term of the Equity Incentive Plan, the maximum number of Common Shares that may be issued under the Equity Incentive Plan will increase by eight percent (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_Lta-x13FW0GTwBjIWRKTBw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="mdrr:CommonStockIncrementalSharesReservedForFutureIssuancePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_p_hHcUZ5gEyB1K45o2-8oQ">8</ix:nonFraction>%) of any additional Common Shares or interests in the Operating Partnership issued (i) after the completion date the Company&#8217;s initial registered public offering of Common Shares, in the case of the January 1, 2019 adjustment, or (ii) in the preceding calendar year, in the case of any adjustment subsequent to January 1, 2020. During the year ended December 31, 2023, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_41VOAvWgO0OehJfbG9nqzA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesIssuedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_V-a9FbfEfEKxCJpfAO2clA">no</ix:nonFraction> shares were issued under the Equity Incentive Plan so no adjustment was made as of January 1, 2024, and the shares available for issuance under the Equity Incentive Plan remained at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_1_1_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_vKqc0-HAIkms-CLzaO7UyA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_T_97ZFv7zEC4UzphulZj6g">61,413</ix:nonFraction> shares. &#160;As of March 31, 2024, there are <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_mdrr_TwoThousandEighteenEquityIncentivePlanMember_Lta-x13FW0GTwBjIWRKTBw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="0" id="Narr_c1rVF5tSqUaNzXkfLpO8pA">4,895</ix:nonFraction> shares available for issuance under the Equity Incentive Plan. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Earnings Per Share</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Basic earnings per share for the Common Shares is calculated by dividing income (loss) from continuing operations, excluding the net income (loss) attributable to noncontrolling interests, by the Company&#8217;s weighted-average number of Common Shares outstanding during the period. Diluted earnings per share is computed by dividing the net income attributable to common shareholders, excluding the net loss attributable to noncontrolling interests, by the weighted average number of Common Shares, including any dilutive shares. As of March&#160;31,&#160;2024 and 2023, respectively, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_ApOtvmcas0a2Geu8SXejKw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_rOHVy4A-3kCER6G19uMZpw">14,960</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_AmUGCsbFH0WQJwtxznkq6Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_TXQtH8ilJE2pZ1iCHpT2MQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LimitedPartnersCapitalAccountUnitsOutstanding" scale="0" id="Narr_8-TuFMITx06PKw7-lpH1Mw">26,691</ix:nonFraction> Operating Partnership Units held by noncontrolling, limited partners were eligible to be converted, on a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2023_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_TXQtH8ilJE2pZ1iCHpT2MQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:CommonUnitToCommonStockConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_Yt4mPlb3V0aefLVe6eB5Lw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JP5OB9LUA02PwG4Yf5p1Eg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_srt_OwnershipAxis_mdrr_OperatingPartnershipUnitHoldersMember_us-gaap_PartnerTypeOfPartnersCapitalAccountAxis_us-gaap_LimitedPartnerMember_us-gaap_StatementEquityComponentsAxis_mdrr_NoncontrollingInterestmemberOperatingPartnershipMember_ApOtvmcas0a2Geu8SXejKw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="mdrr:CommonUnitToCommonStockConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_YWJ0BLZPbkmcchkPazSXQA">one</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>-to-one basis, into Common Shares. For the three months ended March&#160;31,&#160;2023, the Operating Partnership Units and the equivalent Common Shares attributable to the conversion of the Operating Partnership Units have been excluded from the Company&#8217;s diluted earnings per share calculation because their inclusion would be antidilutive. &#160;However, for the three months ended March&#160;31,&#160;2024, the Operating Partnership Units and the equivalent Common Shares attributable to the conversion of the Operating Partnership Units have been included in the diluted earnings per share calculation. &#160;</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">27</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="_d25033bf_38a3_4d48_9670_2c244653658f"></a><a id="_535a30a3_371b_416b_a11a_ca23b85947ac"></a><a id="Tc_yDwOhSfld0i1e7mo-E-IuQ_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_Q_wudrs7O0K11xz3hlLj6Q_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_kvGbaB9qKESM0Ht9tEXyvQ_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_ymSdTzim3EyT_VutuLxKjQ_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_uYU41Qq_QUu9W1yxX5M8gw_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_cnF9oRkBhEeFk6Rs1Mw8wQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_ia2fW0QMNUemU8_BHFqYNQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_3xWyaI6vOEadr5s2t6HaMQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_EvK7pQWwuk-WNJQWk_251g_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_AVQepQMhO0KGtyU0sFlNLQ_9_0"></a><a id="Tc_ypApBMpF5EueHu6vl1-lMg_10_0"></a><a id="Tc__HGla3IgckOM-ScqeyGXJA_10_5"></a><a id="Tc_mVLwRFJtSUCuDiN8OuGZeg_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_B7KaU2v4Y0iB2lzts_rQtQ_12_0"></a><a id="Tc_wng5X0m66kKg3ED3ou2ivA_12_5"></a><a id="Tc_RIa1IYrrnkydXYTP1IrS_A_14_0"></a><a id="Tc_EVSlMM7noEy5m2NPFGGPiQ_15_0"></a><a id="Tc_ytOStC2hwkCJpffthZUs7g_15_2"></a><a id="Tc_3TuD_CpJN0a8_yHEKRc5Rg_16_0"></a><a id="Tc_H4ComsDGb0aO2FvbQ81pkw_17_0"></a><a id="Tc__MljbgkrTUuK1cpOXHbv3A_17_2"></a><a id="Tc_3fLnIqBgd0SrS9fBOqqddw_19_0"></a><a id="Tc_44OMuO5l4EW_nkh6YLu6Lw_20_0"></a><a id="Tc_7iR4pbbSGk2jqWS7jOSnPQ_20_2"></a><a id="Tc_3aGIY74fS0GZqxXgNonfEw_21_0"></a><a id="Tc_qdGb7a1HBkefcu01ZhsV1w_22_0"></a><a id="Tc_YbuWPLB6GE-LL1lrB6kYAA_22_2"></a><a id="Tc_CucpZmsuyUiuGT1nHfqX0w_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_FBHXBhIgwEuPPt0cLKlu6w_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_-4CM9e2dfUCcFUsC9abgFg_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_qglcwsNj1EOT-caHbA2d9w_3_2"></a><a id="Tc_tzevwzi7VU20CJS-gHQ-0Q_3_5"></a><a id="Tc_2mNYzw-6nkuY1OJ_Hskozw_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_6_v0pi-7ykuNq3AV1n4ecQ_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_l4vkdvIIMEGw0oGIEIbFpw_4_5"></a><a id="Tc_eoTDM_7n40KPqKX0WO5MKQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc_FYRKwHOr30muRGJmChrwRg_5_6"></a><a id="Tc_VNRLRKWtTkaxyz9YAgdxDQ_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_I5-0E2FUyECSYNIt0-DH5A_6_6"></a><a id="Tc_J6MpREWunU-B1rA7U-hiDA_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_zX06zKHd90yAZ8v_D1-wnw_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_GAvxo-64_0uRrYigOCQdUQ_8_2"></a><a id="Tc_CcNmdk4pSUO1keLFu92sgA_8_5"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_6o6fZN_-Hkabt7Tdq3vMGQ_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:36pt;margin:0pt;">The Company's earnings (loss) per common share is determined as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2024_To_3_31_2024_c98__lW_mkiq4m2Cg5AVMw" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfEarningsPerShareBasicAndDilutedTableTextBlock" id="Tb_2JV23savF0miGS7kXs6nGw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:98.74%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:61.2%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:3.79%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-si